g":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the bug\n\nWith this setup:\n```\napplication.properties:  quarkus.http.host=macbook\n/etc/hosts: 192.168.1.11 macbook macbook-admin ...\n```\n\nand 192.168.1.11 being unreachable, Quarkus fails to start and logs this message:\n\n`Caused by: io.quarkus.runtime.QuarkusBindException: Port(s) already bound: 8089: Can't assign requested address`\n\nThis is misleading, and a serious time waster when you forgot to adjust /etc/hosts after moving from one network to another.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe log message should clearly indicate that the interface doesn't exist.\n\n\n### How to Reproduce?\n\nSet quarkus.http.host to a dns name that resolves to an unreachable network address.\n\n\n### Quarkus version or git rev\n\n3.19.2\n\n### Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`)\n\nNot relevant\n","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/47119/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.gith